# Splits a header value into its tokens.
#
# Semicolon and comma both separate: the header is typed by hand and both
# spellings are in the vaults already.
#
# It does not handle the word 'nothing' or library prefixes: the two callers treat them differently.
Do out.$define(tok)
Calculate raw as replaceall(pText,';',',')
While len(raw)
	Calculate p as pos(',',raw)
	If p
		Calculate tok as trim(mid(raw,1,p-1),kTrue,kTrue,kSp)
		Calculate raw as mid(raw,p+1)
	Else
		Calculate tok as trim(raw,kTrue,kTrue,kSp)
		Calculate raw as ''
	End If
	If len(tok)
		Do out.$add(tok)
	End If
End While
Quit method out